  "body": "Is there a correct way to specify markup instead of plain text as a complex property value? E.g. a table or a MATHML (sub)tree representing a formula (where elements are relevant to the value itself).\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/microdata.html#values\r\n> The property value of a name\\-value pair added by an element\r\n> ...\r\n> Otherwise\r\n> The value is the element's descendant text content\\.",
